*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0045
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-03-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 502
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0045.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> DEPOSIT TERM IN MONTHS
    05 DEPOSIT-TERM       PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 INT-RATE           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 3000-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "INT-RATE=" INT-RATE
    STOP RUN.
3000-TERM-RATE.
    *> SHORT TERM DEPOSIT RATE
    IF DEPOSIT-TERM >= 1 AND <= 3
        MOVE 0.0300 TO INT-RATE
    *> MEDIUM TERM DEPOSIT RATE
    ELSE IF DEPOSIT-TERM >= 4 AND <= 18
        MOVE 0.0375 TO INT-RATE
    *> LONG TERM DEPOSIT RATE
    ELSE IF DEPOSIT-TERM >= 19 AND <= 60
        MOVE 0.0450 TO INT-RATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.0150 TO INT-RATE
    END-IF
    END-IF
    END-IF.
